+{"object": "ruling", "oracle_id": "b5b049d4-242a-48ec-85d1-1ef66c8cfa4c", "source": "wotc", "published_at": "2017-04-18", "comment": "When Miasmic Mummy’s triggered ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a card to discard, then each other player in turn order chooses a card to discard, then all of those cards are discarded simultaneously. No one sees what the other players are discarding before deciding which card to discard."}
